      "section_label": "Part II Item 1A",
      "category": "GENERAL RISKS",
      "subheading": null,
      "role": "body",
      "text": "The impact of economic conditions on our partners, such as the bankruptcy of a major distributor, OEM, or retailer, could cause sales channel disruption.",
